Due to it being {{Rift Transferable}}, the '''Weirder Tuba''' can be transferred to the [[Hub]] through the Ender Chest next to {{NPCSprite|Inverted Sirius}}. Once in the [[Hub]], the '''Weirder Tuba''' will grant different stats when used, and will have an increased [[Mana|{{DarkAqua|Mana Cost}}]].

